WEBVTT

1
00:00:09,420 --> 00:00:11,420
As expected, their talents have restrictions on their use.

2
00:00:11,420 --> 00:00:13,420
Previously, Uncle Xu could burn four or two monsters.

3
00:00:13,420 --> 00:00:15,420
This time it only lasted more than twenty seconds.

4
00:00:15,420 --> 00:00:16,420
It consumes a lot

5
00:00:16,420 --> 00:00:17,420
It seems like this

6
00:00:17,420 --> 00:00:19,420
My talent is really awesome

7
00:00:19,420 --> 00:00:20,420
No consumption at all

8
00:00:20,420 --> 00:00:22,420
Just get fixed rewards every day

9
00:00:22,420 --> 00:00:26,350
Can the three forbidden walls you hung up be exchanged for materials?

10
00:00:26,350 --> 00:00:27,350
I have bread and wood here

11
00:00:27,350 --> 00:00:29,350
It depends on what you need

12
00:00:29,350 --> 00:00:30,350
I want at least eight units of wood

13
00:00:30,350 --> 00:00:31,350
then ten pieces of bread

14
00:00:31,350 --> 00:00:32,350
Ten bottles of mineral water

15
00:00:32,350 --> 00:00:34,350
Eight units of wood are no problem

16
00:00:34,350 --> 00:00:35,350
Bread is also ok

17
00:00:35,350 --> 00:00:36,480
But I don't have any extra water

18
00:00:36,480 --> 00:00:38,480
Can I use a bread topping?

19
00:00:38,480 --> 00:00:39,480
Give you fifteen more bread toppings

20
00:00:39,480 --> 00:00:40,480
Ten bottles of mineral water

21
00:00:40,480 --> 00:00:43,500
Three forbidden walls exchange for eight units of wood

22
00:00:43,500 --> 00:00:45,500
twenty-five loaves

23
00:00:45,500 --> 00:00:46,730
Bread in the mall now

24
00:00:46,730 --> 00:00:48,730
Although it only costs fifty coins

25
00:00:48,730 --> 00:00:50,730
But each person is limited to one purchase
